[{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02021800_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02021800_03_0010","text":"冬优子\n你在这儿做什么呢？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02021800_03_0012","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02021800_03_0020","text":"啊，是你啊\n别吓我一跳好不好"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02021800_03_0030","text":"抱歉，打扰你休息了吗\n你刚才一直在发呆"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02021800_03_0040","text":"冬优也会发呆的时候啊\n只是想到外面来放松一下而已"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02021800_03_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02021800_03_0050","text":"……我说\n刚才的冬优，有没有很奇怪的表情？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02021800_03_0060","text":"没有\n没那回事啊？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02021800_03_0070","text":"那就好……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02021800_03_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02021800_03_0072","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02021800_03_0080","text":"那种露出破绽的感觉\n对冬优来说也可以接受吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02021800_03_0090","text":"诶？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02021800_03_0100","text":"……没什么"}]
